WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.800
Hi, mystery recapped here. Today I'm&nbsp;
going to explain the action horror film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:15.920
called It Came From The Desert .&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead. Watch out and take care 
&nbsp;

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.640
The movie begins with what seems like a ball&nbsp;
of fire falling from the sky and crashing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:27.440
into the desert in New Mexico leaving&nbsp;
behind a humongous hole on the ground. 
&nbsp;

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:33.440
The movie then fasts forward to 67 years later.&nbsp;
Alarms are going off inside a hidden facility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.280
in the same desert. Armed men are running in fear&nbsp;
looking for a safe exit while battling what seems&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:45.840
like huge ants, bigger in size than all humans.&nbsp;
Unfortunately, one by one all of the men fall&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.320
and none of them make it out alive.
The movie then cuts to two cowboys,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:56.240
Jorge and his pal driving in their Nissan truck&nbsp;
in the desert. They stop at the edge of a chasm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:01.360
and notice a tunnel at the bottom. They bring out&nbsp;
their concrete trolley and venture into the tunnel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:06.320
to fetch any scrap copper they could find. The&nbsp;
tunnel leads to a desolate facility called the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:12.080
Chicane industries. As Jorge inspects the ground&nbsp;
for metal, he is suddenly attacked by giant ants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:16.240
sending his partner running back to the&nbsp;
truck in fear. However, before he could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.880
reach the vehicle, the ant gets to him.
The movie then cuts to a guy named Brian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:25.920
watching a movie called the Eradicator&nbsp;
on his TV in his garage. In the TV film,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:31.680
a blonde girl is being attacked by a hideous&nbsp;
monster and calls out for John “Eradicator” Cage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:36.640
the male protagonist for help. The Eradicator&nbsp;
then shows up in a fancy sports bike.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:41.600
He sprays the green monster with bullets and&nbsp;
rescues the girl like in any cheesy hollywood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:42.640
movie. The girl then throws herself over the hero&nbsp;
and he asks her to give her some “sugar”. The two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:48.240
make out as Brian vicariously lives through the&nbsp;
movie imagining himself as the “Eradicator”.
&nbsp;

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:53.040
Brian is a nerdy university student who works&nbsp;
part-time as a mechanic and repairs racing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:59.600
bikes. Brian’s cool, racer best friend Lukas then&nbsp;
shows up and asks him to hurry up for a party.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.320
Brian and Lukas are excited for the party as&nbsp;
the Eradicator himself is gracing the event&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:09.120
and awarding Lukas his medal for winning&nbsp;
his university’s extreme sports bike race.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:14.000
As they load Lukas’s sports bike on their pick&nbsp;
up truck, a missing people’s poster is seen on a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.880
nearby tree put up by the Chichane industries.
Instead of driving to the desert party,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:24.080
Lukas drives in the opposite direction, which&nbsp;
leads to Brian’s major crush Lisa's home.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:29.040
Lukas reveals that he has invited her to the&nbsp;
party without telling Brian. Brian freaks out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:33.760
and tells him to stop but Lukas tells him that&nbsp;
one day or another he will have to man up and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:39.120
express his feelings to her. Lisa goes to the same&nbsp;
university as Brian and Lukas. She is not only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:44.720
beautiful and cool, she is smart like Brian.
After picking up Lisa, they head to the party&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:49.120
geeking out over the Eradicator franchise.&nbsp;
Halfway to the party, the Guarisco brothers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:54.720
show up on their bikes. They flaunt their bike&nbsp;
stunts, forcing Lukas to prove that he is no less.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:59.680
Lukas asks Brain to take over the steering wheel&nbsp;
and jumps from the truck with his bike to show Tim&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:04.800
and Craig Guarisco who the real boss is.&nbsp;
The two brothers don’t see eye to eye with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:09.920
Lukas and have a war of words with each other&nbsp;
after reaching the party. Brain defuses the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:15.680
situation and asks everyone to enjoy the party. 
At the party, Lukas again encourages Brian to talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:21.120
to Lisa but Brian feels he doesn’t have a cool&nbsp;
personality and can’t do daredevil stunts like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:26.640
Lukas. Lukas asks him to stop his pity party&nbsp;
and suggests him to confidently ask her out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:30.640
cause that’s what girls like. However,&nbsp;
before Brian could even approach her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:36.640
Craig and Tim start hitting on her and Brian&nbsp;
again loses hope. As Lukas gets busy on stage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:40.560
thanking everyone for coming to his&nbsp;
party, Brian wanders into the desert.
&nbsp;

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:45.440
While acknowledging Brian‘s major contribution in&nbsp;
his victory, Lukas notices that Brian is missing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:50.640
from the crowd and goes looking for him. He finds&nbsp;
him on the edge of the chasm . They both notice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:55.920
Jorge’s abandoned truck on the other side of the&nbsp;
chasm and the tunnel down below. Lukas forces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.920 --> 00:04:00.480
Brain to come along with him to check out the&nbsp;
tunnel. They come across the Chichane Industries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:06.240
facility, which Brain says is one of the biggest&nbsp;
military contractors in the US. Afraid of getting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:11.680
shot, Brian advises against entering the private&nbsp;
property but Lukas doesn’t heed his advice.
&nbsp;

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:17.200
As they inspect the elaborate military facility,&nbsp;
Lisa comes looking for them by the chasm. Inside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:22.160
the desolate facility, Brain and Lukas come across&nbsp;
a mess hall and kitchen with a refrigerator that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:27.920
is still cold and operating. They decide to go&nbsp;
further into the facility and find a room labelled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:34.240
"Batch 9". Inside, they find gooey liquids and&nbsp;
webs. They suddenly hear strange sounds coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:39.760
outside. Frightened, Lukas finally decides&nbsp;
to get the hell out of the facility. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:45.040
as they head for the exit, they come across a&nbsp;
giant ant in the mess hall and quickly hide in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:50.560
the kitchen. Lukas gets a call from Lisa and he&nbsp;
tells her that they are stuck in the facility with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:56.240
a giant ant. He manages to ask her to come down to&nbsp;
the tunnel and help them before his phone dies.
&nbsp;

00:04:56.240 --> 00:05:01.600
With no choice than to fight, they arm&nbsp;
themselves with, wait for it, a takoyaki&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:09.360
pan and grill spatula. The ant eventually finds&nbsp;
them in the kitchen and their weapons prove to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:15.200
be useless. The two buddies run to the mess but&nbsp;
the ant jumps over them and blocks their exit. It&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:21.120
corners Lukas but Brain bravely saves his friend&nbsp;
by luring the ant towards himself. He then slides&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:26.560
towards the exit but the ant again jumps over him&nbsp;
and blocks him from running away. Brian hits the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:32.080
button next to the exit and the gate begins to&nbsp;
close. However, the ant grabs him and tries to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:35.280
pull him towards itself. Brian freaks out and&nbsp;
asks for Lukas's help. Lukas rushes towards his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:40.000
friend and tries to pull him out but the ant&nbsp;
starts pulling both of them towards itself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:45.200
The two guys almost resign but suddenly Lisa&nbsp;
appears on the other side and starts hammering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:49.920
the ant, eventually killing the monster.
Lukas celebrates the victory while Lisa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:54.640
speculates that more such ants could attack&nbsp;
them as wounded ants emit alarm pheromones&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:59.760
that send nearby ants into an attack frenzy&nbsp;
and attract more ants from farther away.
&nbsp;

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:07.920
Lisa’s prophecy quickly comes true&nbsp;
and more ants arrive from outside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:12.640
forcing them to go deeper into the facility and&nbsp;
hide. They realise that they are in some sort&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:18.480
of control room. Suddenly, a video starts to play&nbsp;
on one of the computers and a man named Dr. John&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:26.720
Renard, head of the US military project “Them”. He&nbsp;
reveals in 1951 a meteor brought alien creatures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:32.240
on earth. The US contained the creatures and&nbsp;
kept them for testing and experimentation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:37.840
Using a piece of the original alien DNA,&nbsp;
scientists spliced their DNA from fire ants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:42.880
and spiders to create the giant creatures&nbsp;
for military research purposes but one day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:49.520
due to a security breach, the batch 9 broke free&nbsp;
and killed all private security forces. Moreover,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:54.800
one dozen scientists have gone missing and&nbsp;
are presumed dead. Dr. Renard speculates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:59.920
that after feeding, the batch 9 will attempt&nbsp;
to make a colony somewhere dark and cool where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:06.160
the queen ant can lay eggs. He also reveals that&nbsp;
the ants require ethanol to fertilize the eggs.
&nbsp;

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:10.800
Lisa suddenly realises that their desert&nbsp;
party has an endless supply of ethanol&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:17.440
aka alcohol and the trio quickly head to the&nbsp;
party to warn others. However, the army of ants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:22.720
reaches the party before them and launches&nbsp;
an attack, sending everyone into a frenzy.
&nbsp;

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:26.400
Tim and Craig quickly hop on&nbsp;
their bikes and proceed to flee&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:31.920
meanwhile others become victims of the ants one&nbsp;
by one. A small group of ants follows the Guarisco&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:37.280
brothers and manage to trip Craig over and&nbsp;
capture him while Tim helplessly drives away. 
&nbsp;

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:41.600
Brian and his friends finally arrive and&nbsp;
learn that the ants have already wrecked havoc&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:45.760
at the party. They decide to head to the&nbsp;
town but as soon as they get on their trucks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:50.560
they come under attack by an ant. They freak&nbsp;
out and get on two bikes and drive away.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:54.800
They split to trick the ants following them&nbsp;
and Brain heads towards the chasm with Lisa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.800 --> 00:08:03.040
planning to jump over the fissure. However, Lisa&nbsp;
tells him that he can’t make it to the other side&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:07.600
and trips the bike over to stop him. 
 Brian gets upset that she feels he can’t jump over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:13.120
the chasm while she probably thinks Lukas can.&nbsp;
Lisa corrects him and tells him that Lukas can’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:18.240
make it to the other side either. Brian tells her&nbsp;
that Lukas would at least try. Lisa agrees but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:22.960
tells him that’s why she thinks Luksa is an idiot.&nbsp;
She reminds Brian that just because they are in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:30.800
dire situation doesn’t mean he has to do anything&nbsp;
reckless. She tells him that he is smarter than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:35.840
that and that’s why she likes him. Brian is taken&nbsp;
aback by the confession and gets lost in his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:42.560
thoughts meanwhile an ant quietly takes Lisa away.&nbsp;
Brian snaps out of his dreams and Lukas arrives.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:48.080
The two follow the ant to the star caves. Deep&nbsp;
inside the caves, they come across giant glowing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:54.880
ant eggs. They also find Lisa and their friends&nbsp;
from the party wrapped alive inside silk cocoons.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:59.920
Suddenly, an ant shows up but Dr. Renard&nbsp;
appears from behind and kills the ant.
 
&nbsp;

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:04.960
The scientist tells them that they must leave&nbsp;
immediately before the other ants return. Brian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:09.920
refuses to leave without Lisa but Dr. Renard&nbsp;
tells him that they can’t open the cocoon without&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:15.280
special tools. Lukas tells his friend that if&nbsp;
they all die, no one will be able to save Lisa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:20.720
and Brian finally agrees to leave but not before&nbsp;
promising Lisa that he will return to get her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:25.840
As they head towards the facility to fetch tools&nbsp;
required to rescue Lisa and others on foot,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:30.720
Dr. Renard warns them that automated sentry&nbsp;
guns protecting the facility must have been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:36.560
activated after the release of his SOS video. He&nbsp;
also shows them a map containing the locations of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:40.880
the sentry guns around the facility. He further&nbsp;
reveals that the ants will start looking for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:46.960
other sources of prey i.e., the nearest town&nbsp;
which leaves the trio with 30 minutes to act. 
&nbsp;

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:52.960
Halfway to the facility, an ant appears from&nbsp;
behind and impales the scientist. Horrified, Brian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:58.560
and Lukas run away and enter the facility from&nbsp;
the back to avoid getting shelled by machine guns.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:03.680
Passing through the hallway, they come across&nbsp;
a giant gate inside a chamber but fail to open&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:09.040
it. Dejected, they proceed to return but only to&nbsp;
find an ant feeding on a corpse in the hallway,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:13.600
forcing them back into the chamber. Lukas&nbsp;
suggests calling the authorities but Brain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:18.640
fears that the government could nuke the town&nbsp;
to stop the scourge. With no other choice left,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:23.760
they decide to take on the ant. Lukas first&nbsp;
decides to drink a beer in case he dies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:28.800
and grabs a beer can from the refrigerator in the&nbsp;
adjoining room but to their astonishment, it opens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:35.280
the gate. Inside, they find a smart rifle, plasma&nbsp;
bolt cutter and combat suits. Fully equipped,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:40.320
they neutralize the ant outside and head to&nbsp;
the star caves in bikes parked outside.
 
&nbsp;

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:45.520
Brian quieltey frees Lisa and then lures the&nbsp;
ants outside the cave to give Lukas freedom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:50.080
to free other people and destroy the ant&nbsp;
eggs. Brian leads the ants to the facility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:55.440
setting them up to get shelled by the automatic&nbsp;
machine guns. The plan succeeds and they celebrate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.440 --> 00:11:00.160
but only to realise that the queen ant is&nbsp;
still alive and watching over them from above.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:08.160
Fearing for their lives, they drive towards&nbsp;
the chasm, followed closely behind by the ant.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:12.960
Brian initially hesitates from jumping over the&nbsp;
fissure but Lisa gives him some “encouragement”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:17.920
and they successfully make it to the other&nbsp;
side. The two then proceed to flee in Jorge’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:23.120
abandoned pick up truck but the queen ant starts&nbsp;
pulling them towards herself with silk threads.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:27.440
Lisa opens fire on the ant but the&nbsp;
ant manages to take down their truck&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:34.080
along with itself. The two jump out of&nbsp;
the truck and barely make it out alive.
&nbsp;

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.760
Meanwhile, after sending everyone&nbsp;
to safety, Lukas proceeds to set&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:42.720
the nest on fire but an egg hatches and&nbsp;
the baby ant attacks Lukas, accidentally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:47.920
setting the nest on fire in the process. 
 Brian and Lisa arrive outside the cave to learn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:52.960
that Lukas is still inside. Brian proceeds&nbsp;
to head in but Tim stops him, telling him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:57.440
that Lukas saved their lives and he wouldn’t&nbsp;
want his best friend endangering his life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:02.560
Craig arrives on his bike and learns that Lukas&nbsp;
saved everyone’s life but is still stuck inside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:10.400
Craig immediately starts his bike and heads into&nbsp;
the cave as Brian and others nervously wait. 
&nbsp;

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:15.360
The cave eventually explodes and out&nbsp;
comes Craig with Lukas, safe and sound.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:20.720
Everyone erupts into cheers and hugs each other&nbsp;
forgetting whatever animosity they may have had.
&nbsp;

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:24.320
The group returns to their party&nbsp;
and the Eradicator finally arrives.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:30.160
Brian is excited to see his idol and offers him&nbsp;
his last beer. However, a giant ant appears from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:37.200
behind and snatches the beer, scaring the crap out&nbsp;
of the “hero”. However, Brian, Lukas and Lisa do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:42.480
not cower down and point guns at the creature.
